{"seq":1,"slug":"the-republic","title":"共和制","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/the-republic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"abolishing-the-sultanate","title":"废除苏丹制","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/the-republic/abolishing-the-sultanate","wordCount":1522,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"building-a-republic","title":"建立共和国","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/the-republic/building-a-republic","wordCount":1740,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"共和制\">共和制</h1><p>确立共和制，是凯末尔缔造现代土耳其的根本变革。本章考察这一变革。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;废除苏丹制&quot;——他终结奥斯曼王朝、摧毁旧政治根基的果断抉择。第二篇文档讲述&quot;建立共和国&quot;,呈现他以共和制取代君主专制、缔造现代国家。</p>\n"}